Neovim Specific Scripts
But to be honest. Very Adaptable.
======================================

  console.lua           client for the hub's Lua console socket
  utils.lua             <see credit line-adapted from: .....>
  px_keymaps.lua        the keymaps below.

Setup
-----

It's a Neovim plugin. You can drop it in your ~/.config/nvim/lua folder
then add to your init.lua or however you do local plugins with your
setup. I don't know your life.

Keymaps:

	<leader>ps	send the buffer, or visual mode selection
	<leader>pl	send the line
	<leader>pp	list the hub's scripts, attach to one
	<leader>pj	journal in a terminal split
	<leader>pi	choose a different hub
	<leader>pd	detach buffer

Uppercase second letter will cache sudo.
